    "title": "ふふふ(*´◒`*)",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13127137.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170414054507/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13127137.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "y4WPpWZ4Gy.jpg",
            "media": "7d2b11ad322d.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hqOBLGwAJLmB_NQDsV1xRNz1oKA8GVjRoFU05WgpjJE4KWTlgF087VgVrbCoxXSFrCxgaYhJNdwQqfjV0GFYeeBpFCQIIZhdLJzsTGloweFBbBG0yQlBhDg81c1FUAiw3RFBnAwg2JA"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "CMのナレーション録りに行ってきました！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "去录了广告的旁白！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I went to record a narration for a commercial!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "自分の歌声にそろそろなれてきましたが喋る声にはまだまだ慣れません。うわああああああって頭を抱えたくなります。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "对自己的歌声总算渐渐习惯了，但对说话的声音还是很不习惯。好想抱着头喊“呜哇啊啊啊啊啊”。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm getting used to my singing voice by now, but I still can't get used to my speaking voice. I want to hold my head and go \"aaaaaaah\"."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "骨伝導で普段きいている自分のマイボイスなんてただの幻想なんだぜ…\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "796175789e84.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00176.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "平时通过骨传导听到的自己的声音什么的，不过是幻想罢了……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The sound of my own voice that I normally hear through bone conduction is nothing but an illusion…"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "私ごとですが、大手町で靴が壊れました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "说点我自己的事——我在大手町把鞋弄坏了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is a personal thing, but my shoes broke in Otemachi."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "お気に入りの靴の踵がパッカパカ！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "心爱的鞋子鞋跟啪嗒啪嗒裂开了！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The heel of my favorite shoes is flapping!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "まだ買って2ヶ月なのに〜〜"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "明明才买了两个月呀～～"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'd only had them for two months~~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "前も大手町で物を壊し…"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "之前也是在大手町弄坏过东西……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I broke something in Otemachi before too…"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "くほおお悲しい\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "09a33ffaa541.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00006.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "呜呜呜呜好伤心"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Wahhh, so sad"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "09a33ffaa541.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00006.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "09a33ffaa541.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00006.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "09a33ffaa541.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00006.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ただそれだけです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "就这样而已啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "That's all."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "CMみる機会ありましたら、あったかい目と耳でよろしくお願いします(｀・ω・´)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "如果有机会看到这支广告，请用温暖的目光和耳朵多多关照(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you get the chance to see the commercial, please watch and listen with warm eyes and ears(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "嘿嘿嘿(´◒`)",
    "titleEn": "Hehehe(*´◒`*)"
